── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────────────────── E0100_map_literal.lt:2:20  [E0100]

Stilt has no map literal: `Map.from_entries` builds a map from pairs:

  2 │   let ages = {"ada": 36, "alan": 41}
    │                    ^

A map is built from a list of `(key, value)` pairs, or with `Map.new()` and
`m[k] = v`.

To fix it, write `Map.from_entries`:

  2 │   let ages = Map.from_entries([("ada", 36), ("alan", 41)])
    │              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
